  "description": "YDotNet.Repository is a flexible and robust implementation of the Repository pattern for .NET applications. It provides a clean abstraction layer between your domain model and data access logic. Features include:\n\n- Generic repository implementation\n- Entity Framework Core integration\n- Async/await first design\n- CRUD operations support\n- Specification pattern support\n- Query optimization capabilities",
